# Reproducible working-tree line endings.
#
# core.autocrlf=true is the default on many Windows Git installations; without
# this file a fresh clone checks out CRLF and `npm run format:check` fails in
# every clone even though the committed blobs are LF. Force LF in the working
# tree for all text files so the formatter gate is clone-stable.
* text=auto eol=lf
